 en:{kicker:'JOYAGOO / DISCOVERY STUDIO',heading:'Find the product. Make the next step count.',intro:'Use one clear route from a product idea to its live record, then keep the QC questions that actually matter.',s1:'Search a style',s2:'Choose a category',s3:'Keep the evidence',spotlight:'ON THE RADAR',spotlightText:'A direct product route with the category checks beside it — no endless product wall.',routes:'MAKE YOUR ROUTE',catsTitle:'Choose your lane',catsText:'Ten focused product areas. Each one opens the matching FindSpreadsheet category directly.',reading:'READ BEFORE YOU DECIDE',closing:'Clear product research, with a sharper point of view.',closingText:'Use the guide to narrow the question. Use the live database only when you are ready to compare a specific result.'},
